===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|galery}}, {{m|enm|gallerye}}, from {{der|en|frm|galerie}}, {{m|frm|gallerie}}, from {{der|en|fro|galerie}}, {{m|fro|gallerie|t=a long portico, a gallery}}, from {{der|en|la-med|galeria|t=gallery}}, of {{unk|en|title=unknown origin}}. Perhaps an alteration of {{der|en|la|galilea|t=church porch}}, probably from {{der|en|la|Galilaea}}, Galilee, region of Israel. More at {{l|en|Galilee}}.<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref>

